  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Header.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Description.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">本模组旨在让玩家体验中世纪骑士的感觉。目前，该模组包含大量新的旗帜图案、16套盔甲、8种盾牌和26种武器，其中大部分可以使用11种可用材料制作：木头、石头、铁、金、钻石、下界合金、钢（新增）、铜、银、锡和青铜。这些武器拥有特殊属性，如增加攻击范围和破甲效果。此外，本模组还向游戏中添加了钢材，且不会与其他模组中的钢材发生冲突。要将铁矿石炼制成钢锭，只需将其放入高炉即可。使用此模组，你可以将旗帜附着在盔甲或马铠上（就像在盾牌上一样），也可以添加盔甲装饰——许多装饰都可以染成任意颜色。配置文件位于&nbsp;<code>config/epicknights</code> 文件夹中。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>扩展包：<br></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Addon</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-dark-ages-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Dark Ages</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-slavic-armory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Slavic Armory</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-antique-legacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Antique Legacy</a><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-ores-and-alloys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Ores and Alloys</a><br><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-artillery-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Artillery Addon</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rk-medieval-boomsticks-and-sharpsticks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ranged Knights Medieval Boomsticks and Sharpsticks</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-open-helms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights: Open Helms</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>重要提示：Optifine 1.20 及更高版本会导致包括本模组在内的许多模组出现故障！<br></strong></span>自 7.0 版本起，本模组需要安装 Architectury API 和 Cloth Config。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Roadmap.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/jLgF2Sp/discord-new-2021-logo-45-D326-F28-C-seeklogo-com.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"50\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">如果您正在寻找一个利用 Epic Knights 盔甲及其所有扩展包的历史服务器，请随时查看&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/agVWxf8VGc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Greatest of Centuries</a>。这是一个阵营服务器，专注于通过各种独特的机制和玩家驱动的角色扮演，重现围绕君士坦丁堡陷落的历史冲突。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Compatibilities.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a><strong>：</strong>1.18.2+：支持预设。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a>：<br>1.20.1 和 1.21.1：支持预设</p>\n<p>要在旧版本中将 Epic Knights 与 Epic Fight 结合使用，请执行以下操作：</p>\n<p>1.12.2：从&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>下载 epicfight.cfg 并将其放入配置文件夹中。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">1.16.5, 1.18.2, 1.19.2：从 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/R8U8Hpgr75\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>下载数据包，解压后按照本教程操作：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fTutorials%252fInstalling%252f_a%252f_data%252f_pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft.fandom.com/wiki/Tutorials/Installing_a_data_pack</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/knightarmory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">32x32 资源包</a> 有一个由 Reymecos 精心制作的 32x 资源包，注重细节：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/knightarmory\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/knightarmory</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overgeared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Overgeared</a>：<br>使用以下数据包使 Overgeared 与 Epic Knights 兼容：<br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-epic-knights-armors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-epic-knights-armors</a><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-x-epic-knights-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/overgeared-x-epic-knights-weapons</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Armor.webp\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1446/478/sprite-0001-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3600\" height=\"3600\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Weapons.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1022/118/weapons-and-shield.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Designs.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/397/342/2021-09-26_19.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Epic_Knights/BH_Epic_Knights_Screenshot.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"1243\"></strong>报告您发现的任何错误！！！&nbsp;是的，您可以将其用于发布在 CurseForge 和 Modrinth 上的整合包</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
